  "title": "Summer Salad with Grilled Corn and Cherry Tomatoes",
  "description": "This summer salad with grilled corn and cherry tomatoes recipe includes bell pepper, onion, and basil with a rice wine vinegar and lime vinaigrette.",
  "authors": [
